### INSTRUÇÕES:
### 1. Execute o teste 2 (Login com ADMIN)
### 2. Copie o token JWT do response
### 3. Cole o token aqui: @JWT_TOKEN = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
### 4. Depois execute os demais testes

### 0. PRIMEIRO: Criar usuário ADMIN
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminSenha@123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 1. Cadastro de novo usuário
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "role": "ENG"
}

### 2. SEGUNDO: Login com ADMIN (Executar este para gerar o token JWT)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminSenha@123"
}

### 2. SEGUNDO: Login com USER
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### 3. Obter dados do usuário autenticado (GET /users/me)
GET {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 4. Listar todos os usuários (Requer role ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 5. Obter usuário por ID
GET {{host}}/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 6. Atualizar usuário (PATCH /users/{id})
PATCH {{host}}/users/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "João Silva Atualizado",
  "email": "joao.novo@example.com",
  "password": "NovaSenha@123"
}

### 8. Criar segundo usuário para testes
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Santos",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@456",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 9. Criar usuário com role ENG
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "abanan Engineer",
  "email": "asdsadas@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@789",
  "role": "ENG"
}


### Projects CRUD tests (use same @JWT_TOKEN)
# Create project
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Obra de Teste teste",
  "cep": "80000-000",
  "street": "Rua das Flores",
  "number": "100",
  "complement": "",
  "city": "Curitiba",
  "state": "PR",
  "projectType": "RESIDENTIAL",
  "category": "HOUSE",
  "landArea": 250.00,
  "builtArea": 180.00,
  "status": "PLANNING",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-01",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### List projects
GET {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### Get project by id (replace 5 with created id)
GET {{host}}/projects/6
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### Update project (PATCH)
PATCH {{host}}/projects/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "cep": "80100-000",
  "street": "Av. Atualizada",
  "number": "200",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Delete project
DELETE {{host}}/projects/5
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### Add member to project
POST {{host}}/projects/5/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "userId": 37,
  "roleInProject": "FOREMAN"
}

### List project members
GET {{host}}/projects/6/members
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### Unauthenticated request (should return 401)
GET {{host}}/projects

### ============================================================
### STAGES CRUD TESTS
### ============================================================

### 1. Criar uma etapa em um projeto
POST {{host}}/projects/6/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "Fundação",
  "description": "Execução das fundações diretas e indiretas da obra",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-01",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-07-15"
}

### 2. Listar todas as etapas de um projeto
GET {{host}}/projects/6/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 3. Obter uma etapa específica
GET {{host}}/stages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 4. Atualizar uma etapa (PATCH - atualização parcial)
PATCH {{host}}/stages/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "actualStartDate": "2026-06-05"
}

### 5. Deletar uma etapa
DELETE {{host}}/stages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 6. Criar segunda etapa para reorder
POST {{host}}/projects/5/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "Estrutura",
  "description": "Execução da estrutura de concreto armado",
  "displayOrder": 2,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-07-16",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-09-15"
}

### 7. Criar terceira etapa para reorder
POST {{host}}/projects/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "Alvenaria",
  "description": "Levantamento das paredes e divisórias internas",
  "displayOrder": 3,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-09-16",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### 8. Reordenar etapas (trocar ordem)
### Exemplo: enviar [3, 2, 1] para inverter a ordem
POST {{host}}/projects/1/stages/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

[2, 3, 1]

### 9. Listar etapas após reorder para verificar mudança
GET {{host}}/projects/1/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 10. Teste de erro: criar etapa com displayOrder duplicado
POST {{host}}/projects/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "Cobertura",
  "description": "Instalação de telhado",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### 11. Teste de erro: criar etapa com datas inválidas
POST {{host}}/projects/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "name": "Instalações",
  "description": "Instalações elétricas e hidráulicas",
  "displayOrder": 4,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-11-15",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-11-01"
}
